  "description": "Yoon Seoah is an ordinary city woman whose life is turned upside down when a plane crash leaves her stranded on a deserted island. With her survival hanging by a thread, the only person she can rely on is Pyo Taejeong, the other sole survivor. Blessed with almost unreal handsomeness and a chilling gaze, Taejeong possesses an overwhelming survival instinct that never falters, even in the harshest conditions.\n\n*“Take off everything except your underwear.”*\n\nBefore she knows it, Seoah finds herself being swept along by Taejeong’s bold and uncompromising ways. Stranded together with nowhere to run and no one else to depend on, will the two of them actually make it home alive?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
